  "sources": {
    "pm_spec": {
      "path": "specs/in-progress/points-redemption/pm-spec.md",
      "exists": true,
      "sections": [
        {
          "anchor": "PM§會員點數兌換 (PM spec)",
          "title": "會員點數兌換 (PM spec)",
          "level": 1,
          "line": 1,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§1",
          "title": "背景與目標",
          "level": 2,
          "line": 3,
          "text": "member 累積點數卻無法線上 redeem。目標:線上 redeem Reward,並維持可靠的點數帳本。"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§2",
          "title": "使用者與情境",
          "level": 2,
          "line": 6,
          "text": "member:想 redeem Reward 並 view PointTransaction。 system:讓舊點數 expire。"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§3",
          "title": "功能需求",
          "level": 2,
          "line": 9,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§3.1",
          "title": "PointsAccount 點數足夠時 member 可 redeem Reward",
          "level": 3,
          "line": 10,
          "text": "PointsAccount 餘額足夠時, member 可以 redeem Reward。 Redemption 初始為 Pending,扣點記為一筆 PointTransaction,由 RewardVendor 出貨。"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§3.2",
          "title": "點數 12 個月後 expire",
          "level": 3,
          "line": 13,
          "text": "12 個月未使用的點數會 expire。 system 每月排程寫一筆 expire PointTransaction,並扣減 PointsAccount 餘額。"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§3.3",
          "title": "member 可 view PointTransaction",
          "level": 3,
          "line": 16,
          "text": "member 可以 view 每筆 PointTransaction,含日期、類型與點數。"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§4",
          "title": "非功能需求",
          "level": 2,
          "line": 19,
          "text": "即使並行 redeem, PointsAccount 餘額也不得為負。"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "PM§5",
          "title": "驗收條件",
          "level": 2,
          "line": 22,
          "text": "- 餘額足夠 → member redeem Reward → 建立 Redemption 並呼叫 RewardVendor\n- 餘額不足 → member redeem Reward → 回應 422 INSUFFICIENT_POINTS,不扣點\n- 點數於 13 個月前取得 → 每月排程執行 → 寫入 expire PointTransaction,餘額減少\n- member 有 PointTransaction → member 開啟紀錄 → 每筆 PointTransaction 顯示日期、類型、點數"
        }
      ],
      "lines": 26
    },
